  "Question": "The smallest of 3 consecutive integers is \\(n\\), so the integers, in order, are \\(n\\), \\(n+1\\), and \\(n+2\\). Their sum can be expressed using a letter. When \\(n=7\\), what is the sum of these 3 integers?",
